+Show the Configuration
+----------------------
+
+To check which configuration values your application has loaded, use the
+:func:`config <cli.config_command>` command. It prints the configuration as
+JSON. The values of keys containing ``SECRET``, ``PASSWORD``, ``TOKEN`` or
+``KEY`` are masked as ``"***"`` so the output can be shared safely. ::
+
+    $ flask config
+    {
+      "APPLICATION_ROOT": "/",
+      "DEBUG": false,
+      "SECRET_KEY": "***",
+      ...
+    }
+
+
 .. _dotenv:
 
